WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:03.940
If you have a job interview or an interview for an internship,

2
00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.540
chances are the recruiters are already satisfied

3
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:10.140
with your skill set, your experience or your degree.

4
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:15.700
What they actually want to see is how you are and what you are like as a person.

5
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:19.800
And that is why it’s important to make a good first impression.

6
00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.540
You only get one chance.

7
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.900
And before you get to say anything,

8
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:28.000
they have already started forming a general idea about who you are as a person.

9
00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:32.620
And that will definitely influence how the rest of the interview goes.

10
00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:35.700
So there are certain things to pay attention to

11
00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:38.460
in order to make a good first impression.

12
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.860
First thing: appearance and body language.

13
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:45.540
It’s very important to look professional, to dress well,

14
00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:50.900
have good hygiene and look confident, even if you are not.

15
00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:54.500
It is okay to be stressed. It is okay to be anxious. It’s completely normal.

16
00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:57.020
Just don’t let it get the best of you.

17
00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:59.480
Try to stay on top of everything.

18
00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:01.810
Second thing: communication.

19
00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:04.750
It’s very important to speak clearly and politely,

20
00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:08.190
and especially, do not interrupt them.

21
00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:11.000
Remember, recruiters are not looking for robots.

22
00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:14.000
They’re looking for human beings with personalities.

23
00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:16.820
So be prepared, be confident,

24
00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:19.220
but most importantly, be yourself.

25
00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:24.220
And don’t underestimate the power of first impressions,

26
00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:28.580
because sometimes even the smallest details can make all the difference.

27
00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:29.850
Thank you.
